      "title": "CloudTeamCompany EMEA - SalesForce Developer - Remote/UK/NL - 90,000 EURO/Year",
      "description": "Region: Remote/UK/NL\nSalary: EUR 90,000 per year\n\nFancy yourself a code-slinging, cloud-wrangling wizard? 🧙‍♂️✨\nCloudTeamCompany EMEA wants YOU to bring your Salesforce sorcery to our team. If you ever dreamed of bending clouds to your will, making data dance, and turning code into poetic elegance—all while working from the comfort of your favorite chair—then let's chat.\n\nWhat You’ll Do:\nCode Crafting: Develop tailor-made Salesforce solutions that solve problems faster than you can say \"cloud computing\".\nData Diva: Manage and manipulate data streams, ensuring everything flows smoother than your morning coffee (or tea, we’re equal opportunity caffeinators here).\nTroubleshooting Titan: Diagnose and fix issues before they become full-blown software soap operas.\nWhat You Need:\nSalesforce development experience (bring proof of electronic wizardry).\nFluent in Apex, Visualforce, and Lightning Components (basically, if your keyboard had a martial art, this would be it).\nProblem-solving skills with the speed and agility of a caffeinated squirrel.\nWhat’s in It for You?\nRemote Wonderland: Work from wherever your heart desires—the UK, the Netherlands, or your sofa (just keep the PJ selfies to yourself).\nCompetitive Pay: EUR 90,000 per year—because your talents are golden and we believe in rewarding your coding superpowers.\nCool Colleagues: Join a team that’s as dynamic and innovative as the solutions we create. We also appreciate fine puns and nerdy t-shirts.",
